s, 25 consulted references; all 288 recorded witnesses/full-cap failures arithmetically verified; canonical figure schema/density and JSON pointers checked; scientific-evidence report has zero dangling references. Final evaluator source digest matches. Scoped implementation-identity caveat retained.\nNext: Parent must synchronously render the reserved conceptual overview and perform authoritative final geometry/figure validation. Numerical plots and manuscript are ready; no new experiment or evaluator rerun is required.\n_No conclusions yet._\n6:* default (event append) — appends one memory event to ``memory.md`` (local +\n222:    parser.add_argument(\n228:    parser.add_argument(\"--event-json\", default=None, help=\"Event payload as JSON object string\")\n229:    parser.add_argument(\"--event-file\", default=None, help=\"Path to event JSON file\")\n230:    parser.add_argument(\n231:        \"--local-memory-md\",\n232:        default=\"./memory.md\",\n235:    parser.add_argument(\n236:        \"--global-memory-md\",\n240:    parser.add_argument(\n246:    parser.add_argument(\n251:    parser.add_argument(\n256:    parser.add_argument(\n261:    parser.add_argument(\n267:    parser.add_argument(\n273:    parser.add_argument(\n278:    parser.add_argument(\n388:    if not args.global_memory_md or not args.global_memory_jsonl:\n390:            \"append_memory: --global-memory-md and --global-memory-jsonl are required \"\n400:    local_memory_path = Path(args.local_memory_md)\n401:    global_memory_md_path = Path(args.global_memory_md)\n405:    _append_text(global_memory_md_path, _markdown_entry(event), header=GLOBAL_MEMORY_HEADER)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
